		{
			dependencies: ["583A7AA84FEC027F"]
			description: ["Congratulations! Getting the builder upgraded is an important step. The Builder can only build or upgrade any other hut up to the level of their own hut. So, in order for the Builder to upgrade any building, the Builder’s Hut must be upgraded first. Then the Builder will be able to upgrade any other building(s)."]
