		{
			dependencies: ["583A7AA84FEC027F"]
			description: ["The Crusher’s Hut is where the Crusher will take items and crush them into other blocks. Most notably cobblestone = gravel, gravel = sand, sand = clay. One important factor to know is that the crusher has a daily limit based on the hut level. Level 1 has a daily max of 16, level 2 has 64. At level 5 it’s daily max is 999. "]
